    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "pandas.Series.__iter__# Series.__iter__()[source]# Return an iterator of the values. These are each a scalar type, which is a Python scalar (for str, int, float) or a pandas scalar (for Timestamp/Timedelta/Interval/Period) Returns: iterator Examples >>> s = pd.Series([1, 2, 3]) >>> for x in s: ... print(x) 1 2 3",
